@startuml SmartAutoCar_Activity
!theme plain
title Smart Auto — Activity: help request → accept → chat (schema-aligned)

|Requester|
start
:Register / login (auth.users);
:Trigger **handle_new_user** → row in **profiles**;
:Create **requests** (status = open);
note right
  RLS: insert as owner (user_id = auth.uid())
end note

|Driver|
:List **open** requests\n(RLS: status = 'open');
:Insert **request_responses**\n(status = pending);
note right
  unique (request_id, driver_id)
end note

|Requester|
:Review **request_responses**;
:Accept driver:\nUPDATE **request_responses** → accepted\nUPDATE **requests** → accepted;

|System|
:Ensure **chats** row\n(1:1 with request_id);
note right
  RLS: **is_chat_participant**()\nrequester OR accepted driver
end note

|Users|
:Send and receive **messages**\n(both requester and driver);
floating note right
  Realtime on **messages**;
  **read_at** for read receipts
end note

stop

@enduml
